    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## The Green Gardener: Designing for Sam\r\n\r\n**The User:** Sam needs a digital plant-tracking app with a built-in watering schedule. He is often outside, in direct sunlight, with dirt on his hands while using the app.\r\n\r\n**Step 1.** Prompt AI to generate your web app layout (HTML). \r\n\r\n::: details [**What should I write in my prompt?**]\r\nThink about it:\r\n> What information (e.g. plant type, watering schedule, ready to harvest) should the app keep track of?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n**Step 2.** Prompt AI to generate your page style (CSS).\r\n\r\n::: details [**What should I write in my prompt?**]\r\nThink about it:\r\n> What colors, buttons, and text should the page use to be visible in extreme sunlight?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n**Step 3.** Add images to your site.\r\n\r\n**Step 4.** Use your handout checklist to add more features to your web page.",
